Dear players, for the feedback of the players, we carefully update and adjust the following content:

1, level difficulty
Reduce the difficulty of the BOSS of the adventure level;

2, hero adjustment
In the adventure campaign, the player is allowed to freely select the hero corresponding to this chapter without unlocking it;

3, the pub is unlocked
A. Invite the lord companion: The player unlocks the lord by purchasing the wine at the store, and selects the companion with the lord at the pub, and can directly recruit the corpus corresponding to the lord in any mode. After unlocking the bio-recruitment skill by consuming the depreciation with the NPC, the NPC can be recruited at any time;
B, increase the value of devaluation: regardless of the adventure mode or the encounter, killing any monster can get the depreciation of the peer lord.

4, the second confirmation before the army
In the upper right corner of the interface, the [Remove before the enemy battle] button is added.

5, add the button of [quick reopen]
In the upper right corner of the interface, the [Fast Reopen] button is added to facilitate the player to start the game again;

6, national level card BUG
A, repair the simple mode of Laos, select other heroes and enter the battle, still use the BUG of the Royal Swordsman;
B, repair the BUG in the Laos checkpoint, using the dwarf guard to enter the black screen after the battle;
